WEBVTT

00:00:56.746 --> 00:01:01.371
we create civilizations, theories,
technologies,

00:01:04.079 --> 00:01:06.079
and we reach beyond the planet.

00:01:08.163 --> 00:01:11.371
In honor of the life and work
of Sir Ken Robinson,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:16.454
TED-Ed invites you to reimagine 
the aspects of life we take for granted

00:01:16.454 --> 00:01:20.538
by finishing the sentence: 
imagine if ...

00:01:21.954 --> 00:01:27.746
Visit ed.ted.com/ImagineIf
to learn more.